# Blog posts live here.
#
# Drop a .mdx file in this folder to publish a post. Required frontmatter:
#
# ---
# title: 'Your post title'
# description: 'One-line summary for SEO and the index page.'
# date: 2026-06-01
# tags: ['systems', 'infra']
# draft: false
# ---
#
# The /blog index automatically switches from the "coming soon" state to a
# real post list as soon as the first non-draft post exists.
